#. Description of the plugin
#: beltoft-hardening.php
msgid "Closes the user-enumeration routes an attacker uses to learn an administrator's login name, makes login failures uniform, keeps administrators on wp-login.php, hides author details from oEmbed and the public REST API, and can answer 404 to visitors who ask for the login screen or the admin area."
msgstr ""

